<title>PAKISTAN: EU grants Pakistan $32 mln for rural development.</title>
<headline>EU grants Pakistan $32 mln for rural development.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union gave Pakistan 25 million ECUs (about $32 million) on Tuesday to finance a five-year rural social development programme.</p>
<p>The EU said in a statement the programme was aimed at increasing access to basic social services for rural and semi-urban populations.</p>
<p>The programme will focus on basic education, primary health care and population welfare, the main sectors covered by the government's Social Action Programme.</p>
</text>
